		"description": {
			"gm": "",
			"value": "<p><strong>Usage</strong> drawn on a creature</p><hr><p>No matter what skin, shell, or scale this rune is drawn on, it shines like gold. The rune-bearer gains a +1 status bonus to Deception, Diplomacy, and Performance checks.</p><p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e-runesmith-assistant.pf2e-runesmith-assistant-items.Item.1ARstE1wVfXO8pnY]{Effect: Ledria, Rune of Appeal}</p><p><strong>Invocation </strong>The rune draws creatures closer to the bearer. Each creature within 30 feet of the rune-bearer can Step closer to the rune-bearer as a free action.</p><hr><p><strong>Level (9th)</strong> The bonus increases to +2.</p><p><strong>Level (17th)</strong> The bonus increases to +3.</p>"
